            "description": "Readable product label grouped by the authoritative normalized product key; similar labels never merge different products.",
            "expression": "LOWER ( TRIM ( COALESCE ( 'DimDetectedApplication'[DisplayName], \"Unknown application\" ) ) ) & \" · \" & LOWER ( TRIM ( COALESCE ( 'DimDetectedApplication'[Publisher], \"Unknown publisher\" ) ) ) & \" · \" & LOWER ( TRIM ( COALESCE ( 'DimDetectedApplication'[Platform], \"Unknown platform\" ) ) )",
